  "Pioggia da smaltire in 24 ore: 12,96 mm/24h = 1,5 l/s per ettaro": "Rain to drain in 24 hours: 12.96 mm/24h = 1.5 l/s per hectare",
  "Coeff. (mm/24h)": "Coeff. (mm/24h)",
